1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:03,773
(Sheldon:)...to hold back the few superior men.

2
00:00:04,861 --> 00:00:06,191
(Leonard:)That actually does help.

3
00:00:06,946 --> 00:00:09,786
(Sheldon:)It's worth noting
that he died of syphilis.

4
00:00:14,453 --> 00:00:15,743
(Leonard:)Screw it, I'm going.

5
00:00:15,913 --> 00:00:18,253
(Sheldon:)On your way home,
will you pick up orange juice?

6
00:00:18,416 --> 00:00:20,956
(Leonard:)Do you mind? I'm questioning
a lot of things in my Iife.

7
00:00:21,168 --> 00:00:23,958
(Sheldon:)Is one of those things
your fondness for orange juice?

8
00:00:25,047 --> 00:00:26,717
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Great. Tropicana, no pulp.

9
00:00:36,392 --> 00:00:38,732
- Hey, Sheldon.
Who is it?

10
00:00:39,478 --> 00:00:41,478
(Sheldon:)It's me, Sheldon, Mrs. Wolowitz.

11
00:00:41,689 --> 00:00:45,109
(Howard:)That's not my mom. It's Bernadette.

12
00:00:46,485 --> 00:00:49,155
(Sheldon:)Really? That's very unsettling.

13
00:00:49,947 --> 00:00:52,117
- Hi, Sheldon.
- Hi.

14
00:00:52,283 --> 00:00:54,783
(Penny:)- What's up?
- It just occurred to me...

15
00:00:54,952 --> 00:00:58,622
(Sheldon:)...that I never formally congratulated you
on your pending nuptials.

16
00:00:58,789 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)I hopped on the first bus and hightailed
it down here to shake your hand.

